  "locked_terms": [],
  "english_academic": "For example, just as some bathe again and again\nAnd then repeatedly enter a fire,\nLikewise, although dwelling in extreme suffering,\nThey pride themselves on being happy.",
  "translation": "譬如有人數數沐浴，\n而後屢屢入於火中，\n如是雖處於極大痛苦之中，\n卻依然自認安樂。"
